<title>RUSSIA: Russia-No London Club pact signing date till July.</title>
<headline>Russia-No London Club pact signing date till July.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia will not set the signing date for a rescheduling of debt with the London Club group of creditor banks before July 10, Deputy Finance Minister Mikhail Kasyanov said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;We will not be able to make such an announcement before July 10,&quot; he told a news conference.</p>
</text>
